          <Pad Id="RLkRTD21h5bS4uBlZgFN1u" Bounds="60,95,700,46" ShowValueBox="true" isIOBox="true" Value="A geometry carries its coordinate reference system as an SRID. Reproject moves it to another EPSG code and says how well that went.">
